# Rule name matching the filename slug

## Scope

When this applies and when it does not. One short paragraph.

## Requirements

- Imperative, checkable statements.
- One requirement per bullet.
- No style guidance a linter should own.

## References

Point at canonical files rather than copying them:

@path/to/canonical-example.ts

## Precedence

If this rule conflicts with another, state which wins and why. Do not rely
on filename ordering - Cursor does not order rules by filename.
